          "html": "<div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This storyboard contains narratives collected across all Eurosense projects that have been assigned to the Housing and Living Conditions category by the respondents. Narratives are grouped by country and sentiment. Readers can retrieve additional information about the narratives by selecting the country and the sentiment from the public<span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\"> </span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://platform.sensemaker-suite.com/r/d/3642683b-063d-493e-a32d-d6dea369df63\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\">dashboard</span></a> available on <a href=\"http://eurosense.eu\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\">eurosense.eu</span></a><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--darkAccent\">.</span></p></div>",
